<title>MALAYSIA: Sapura Telecom 6-mth net off 51.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Sapura Telecom 6-mth net off 51.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to July 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		6.75	  vs	  13.98</p>
<p>    Turnover		161.70	  vs	 142.37</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 11.89	  vs	  20.07</p>
<p>    Minorities   less     0.50	  vs  add    0.23</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Sapura Telecommunications Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
